.TH CRUCIBLE 1 2026-09-22 "Crucible 1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
crucible \- an independent, XML-free test framework for PHP
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B crucible
.RI [ options ]
.br
.B crucible
.I command
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Crucible
runs a PHP test suite. Its observable behavior targets drop-in
compatibility with PHPUnit 13 suites: the same assertions, attributes,
options, defaults and exit codes, with no XML to configure.
.PP
.B This page is deliberately brief.
It covers starting a run and finding your way; it is not the reference.
The complete manual \(em configuration, the three dialects, coverage,
the browser tier, mutation testing, CI \(em is in the command itself:
.PP
.RS
.B crucible manual
.RE
.PP
That opens the whole document fullscreen, with
.B \(ua/\(da
to scroll,
.B /
to search, number keys to follow a link,
.B \(<-
to go back and
.B q
to quit. Piped or in CI it prints the same text plainly.
.B crucible \-\-help
lists every option; every option is also in HELP.md.
.SH STARTING
.TP
.B crucible \-\-init
Write a
.I crucible.php
for the project.
.TP
.B crucible migrate\-config
Convert an existing
.IR phpunit.xml ,
reporting anything it cannot translate rather than dropping it.
.TP
.B crucible
Run the suite.
.SH COMMON OPTIONS
.TP
.BI \-\-filter " pattern"
Run only tests whose name matches.
.TP
.BI \-\-testsuite " name"
Run only the named suite.
.TP
.B \-\-coverage
Collect line coverage and print the per\-file summary.
.TP
.BI \-\-parallel " N"
Run test classes in N worker processes.
.TP
.B \-\-changed
Run only tests affected by the working tree's changes.
.TP
.BI \-\-view " key"
Choose the progress view:
.BR map ,
.B map\-fullscreen
(the default at a terminal) or
.B console
(the default in CI and pipes).
.SH OTHER COMMANDS
.TP
.B crucible manual
The full manual. Add
.BI \-\-out= file
to write it as a PDF instead.
.TP
.BI "crucible completion " shell
Print the tab\-completion script for
.BR bash ,
.B zsh
or
.BR fish .
.TP
.B crucible extensions
List the registered report formats, subscribers and progress views.
.TP
.B crucible mutate
Mutation\-test the covered source and report the score.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Everything the exit\-code policy counts as success.
.TP
.B 1
Failures, errors, or anything a
.B \-\-fail\-on
switch promoted.
.TP
.B 2
The run could not proceed \(em a configuration error, no tests found, an
unknown option, or a suite that could not be built.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I crucible.php
The project's configuration, returned as a built object. The only
configuration file Crucible reads.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR php (1)
.PP
.B crucible manual
for the complete manual, and
.UR https://cruciblephp.com
.UE
for the project.
